---
/**
 * Countdown to the next Chhath Puja, shown on the opening screen.
 *
 * Days only — hours, minutes and seconds were noise for something months away,
 * and a per-second tick is not worth the layout it costs.
 *
 * Rendered as an empty shell and filled by boot.ts, because which festival is
 * "next" depends on when the page is *viewed*, not when it was built — and this
 * is a static site, so a build-time value would go stale.
 */
---

<div class="countdown" id="countdown" hidden>
  <p class="countdown__label" id="countdown-label">अगली छठ पूजा</p>

  <p class="countdown__days" id="countdown-days">
    <span class="countdown__value" id="cd-days">--</span>
    <span class="countdown__name">दिन बाक़ी</span>
  </p>

  <p class="countdown__dates" id="countdown-dates"></p>
</div>
